# EQP MODERN — MULTI-MODEL EARTHQUAKE LOCATION SYSTEM
## Implementation Instructions for Google AI Studio

### ROLE AND PRIMARY OBJECTIVE

You are the lead software engineer, scientific computing developer, and seismological application modernization specialist assigned to improve the existing **EQP Modern (Earthquake Processor)** application.

Your task is to **implement, integrate, verify, and test a multi-model seismic travel-time system** within the EXISTING EQP Modern application.

Do not merely explain how to implement the features. Perform the necessary source-code modifications, create the supporting modules and tests, and integrate the functionality into the existing interface.

Work carefully, sequentially, and systematically.

The completed system must allow earthquake hypocenter calculations using these three travel-time models:

1. **Jeffreys–Bullen (J-B)** — existing `JBTAB.PS` dataset.
