## A3. Existing Scientific Implementation

The current application uses:

`solveHypocenterWithJbtab()`

This performs an iterative damped Gauss–Newton-style hypocenter inversion using J-B travel times.

It obtains travel-time predictions through:

`lookupJbTravelTime()`

The existing solver selector offers:

- `EQP`
- `HypoInverse`

However, the `HypoInverse` selection currently modifies weighting and damping behavior within the same internal solver. It does not execute the official HYPOINVERSE2000 program.

Do not describe it as an independently implemented HYPOINVERSE2000 locator.

Preserve backward compatibility while clarifying this distinction in the GUI as appropriate.

